  <h2 id="ai-risk">Will AI replace data analysts</h2>

  <p>
    This is the question sitting under almost every "is data analyst a good career" search, whether the
    searcher says it directly or not. The honest answer depends on which half of the job you actually do
    day to day.
  </p>

