      <ul>
        {aiComparison.teal.map((item) => (
          <li>{item}</li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--amber">
    <p>
      Natural-language query and dashboard-generation features are moving fast inside mainstream BI
      tools, and that risk sits almost entirely on the routine, repeatable side of the job — the exact
      work the plain-certificate segment is competing over. It does not remove the need for the analyst
      who catches a wrong join, questions a misleading average, or knows which report will actually
      change a decision.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h3>How to use this instead of fearing it</h3>

  <div class="ai-stage-list">
    <div class="ai-stage">
      <span class="ai-stage__num">1</span>
